  "title": "Chicken Papadoris",
  "description": "A savory coconut-garlic gravy drenches sauteed chicken breasts. Any leftovers can be spooned into small puff pastries for a delightful appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "William Uncle Bill Anatooskin"
  ],
